    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'CONTROLS


    Trigger-drag this text area to scroll.


    Left grip
    hold: engage left-arm teleop.

    Right grip hold: engage right-arm teleop.

    Left/right
    trigger tap while gripping: toggle that gripper open / close.

    Left X hold:
    left-arm rotation mode.

    Right A hold: right-arm rotation mode.

    Left
    Y tap: toggle left attachment mode.

    Right B tap: toggle right attachment
    mode.

    Trigger hold while not gripping: drag/rotate workspace handles.

    Panel
    Mode button: switch hand-pose / thumbstick mode.

    Reset buttons: Objects,
    Robots, All Reset, Workspace, or Overhead View.


    Teleop still requires that
    arm''s grip hold before the arm moves.

    Panel: point either controller at
    tabs/buttons. Drag from the floating notch; resize from corner L-notches.'
